<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic, Lattice.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic, Lattice.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it started coverage of LSI Logic Corp and Lattice Semiconductor Corp as buy.</p>
<p>-- LSI fell 1/8 to 30-7/8 and Lattice was off 1-3/8 to 41-3/8.</p>
</text>
